%% Connected care: how Duet and the physician web app meet (Dev 2026-10-25). Each graph owns its
%% side of one patient's connection to one practice; they share events, never states. The
%% connection is live: what the patient connected in Duet flows to the practice for its physician
%% agents to read, until it ends. For my doctor goes only when the patient sends it.
%% compose duet: ../duet-experience/duet.mmd
%% compose physician: ../physician-experience/physician.mmd
%%
%% The practice invites and schedules; Duet receives.
%% shared duet: your practice's invitation reaches you = physician: the invitation is delivered
%% shared duet: your practice's invitation ends = physician: your Cancel the invitation on the patient's connection goes through | physician: the invitation expires
%% shared duet: your practice discharges you = physician: your Discharge on the patient's connection goes through
%% shared duet: your practice schedules your appointment = physician: a visit is scheduled | physician: the practice's visit reaches the patient's Duet
%% shared duet: your practice moves your appointment = physician: the visit is moved
%% shared duet: your practice cancels your appointment = physician: the visit is cancelled
%% shared duet: your practice's appointment passes = physician: the visit ends
%% outside duet: by your practice
%%
%% The patient joins, leaves or deletes their account in Duet; the practice sees it.
%% shared physician: the patient joins and consents = duet: your Share on your practice goes through
%% shared physician: the patient leaves the practice = duet: your Leave on your practice goes through
%% shared physician: the patient's account is deleted = duet: your Delete account on your account goes through
%%
%% The live feed: each change to what the patient shares reaches the practice while connected.
%% shared physician: a shared Duet record arrives = duet: new records arrive | duet: a record is corrected | duet: clinical records arrive from your phone's health app | duet: a clinical record changes in your phone's health app | duet: your phone's readings arrive | duet: a reading is deleted in your phone's health app | duet: you answer a Check-in about your doctor's plan
%% For my doctor stays in Duet until the patient sends it; it arrives like a message from them (Dev 2026-10-26).
%% shared physician: the patient sends For my doctor = duet: your Send to my practice on For my doctor goes through
%% outside physician: by the patient through Duet
%%
%% Duet and the practice always show the same connection.
%% never DuetConnectedPracticeNot: duet: Connected to your practice, sharing & physician: Not connected -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never DuetConnectedPracticeInviting: duet: Connected to your practice, sharing & physician: Invited -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never DuetConnectedPracticeEnded: duet: Connected to your practice, sharing & physician: Connection ended -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never PracticeConnectedDuetNot: physician: Connected & duet: No practice connection -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never PracticeConnectedDuetInvited: physician: Connected & duet: A practice's invitation waits for you -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never PracticeConnectedDuetEnded: physician: Connected & duet: Connection ended -- Duet and the practice show one connection status.
%% never InvitationWithoutPractice: duet: A practice's invitation waits for you & physician: Not connected -- An invitation waits in Duet only while the practice holds it open.
%% never InvitationAfterEnd: duet: A practice's invitation waits for you & physician: Connection ended -- An invitation waits in Duet only while the practice holds it open.
%% never DuetAppointmentWithoutVisit: duet: Appointment from your practice & physician: No visit scheduled -- Duet shows a practice appointment only while the practice's schedule has that visit ahead.
%% never DuetAppointmentAfterVisit: duet: Appointment from your practice & physician: Visit over -- Duet shows a practice appointment only while the practice's schedule has that visit ahead.
%% never DuetAppointmentAfterCancel: duet: Appointment from your practice & physician: Visit cancelled -- Duet shows a practice appointment only while the practice's schedule has that visit ahead.
